<opt:body xmlns:opt="https://www.openpower.tools/ns/opt">
      <p>The interactive sibling of the badge: filter tokens that can toggle their
      pressed state (mirrored as aria-pressed) and be removed. Removing dispatches a
      composed opt-chip-remove event before the chip leaves the DOM.</p>
      <h2>Toggleable</h2>
      <p>
        <opt:chip toggle="" pressed="" variant="info">POWER9</opt:chip>
        <opt:chip toggle="" variant="info">POWER8</opt:chip>
        <opt:chip toggle="" variant="ok">verified only</opt:chip>
      </p>
      <h2>Removable</h2>
      <p>
        <opt:chip removable="" variant="neutral">talos-ii</opt:chip>
        <opt:chip removable="" variant="warning">draft</opt:chip>
      </p>
      <h2>Static</h2>
      <p><opt:chip variant="danger">deprecated</opt:chip></p>
      <h2>Markup</h2>
      <pre>&lt;opt:chip toggle pressed variant="info"&gt;POWER9&lt;/opt:chip&gt;
&lt;opt:chip removable&gt;talos-ii&lt;/opt:chip&gt;</pre>

</opt:body>
